SUMMARY:Solidarity - Ecstatic Dance Wave w/ DJ Karen Funshine @ WWC Bryson
  Gym
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, November 20th\nEvening
  Dance Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\n
 Guest DJ: Karen Funshine (Karen Smith)\, Support Facilitator TBA\n\nIntent
 ion: Solidarity\n\nWe are here as one humanity\, beautifully diverse yet f
 undamentally connected. Can we shift our focus from what separates us to w
 hat unites us? Can we honor our differences without allowing them to divid
 e us? When we come together in shared purpose\, recognizing our interconne
 ctedness and standing together as equals\, something powerful becomes poss
 ible. We are stronger together.\n\n## About DJ Karen Funshine\n\nKaren Fun
 shine (Karen Smith) has been dancing since age 3\, with movement as her li
 felong ally. A veteran raver & EDM enthusiast\, she was delighted to disco
 ver 5Rhythms and ecstatic dance 10 years ago in Austin - a sober and judgm
 ent-free space to get wild & free. She’s since facilitated many women’
 s conscious dance circles and a vibrant live-instrument dance - weaving mu
 sic and somatic movement to alchemize emotion\, open the heart\, and awake
 n joy. Recently relocated to Asheville\, Karen is honored to share her pas
 sion and playfulness with her beautiful new community through the universa
 l language of music and dance.\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the d
 ance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and any
  that come late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe an
 d secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n
 \nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-registration Recommended:\n\n
 VOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register t
 o volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](http
 s://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYn
 JpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFI
 NP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootR
 UE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close at the beginning o
 f the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVE
 S!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our
 -dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0b
 gNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA
 4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nr
 jKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisio
 ns a world that moves in harmony where all are free to be their authentic 
 selves within a loving community. Our mission and aim are to inspire authe
 nticity and healthy community through free-form dance by hosting dance wav
 es for personal and community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit
  organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you o
 n the dance floor!
