SUMMARY:Bee All In - Ecstatic Dance Waves w/ Marta Martín
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, November 22nd\n1st Dan
 ce Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance
  Wave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nFacilita
 tor Marta Martín\n\nIntention: Bee All In\n\n### Be All In\n\n**Sunday\, 
 November 22nd\, 2026**\n**Facilitator:** Marta Martín\nBees are a symbol 
 of Community\, Cooperation and Sweetness. Bees function in cooperation wit
 h others for the health and safety of their whole hive. They communicate w
 ith each other for efficiency . Their final product is the sweetness of ho
 ney which delights us and feeds their community.\n\nHow can we learn from 
 bees to be all in working in community and communicating with each other? 
 What sweetness are we sharing with the world?\n\n## About Marta Martín\n\
 nMarta (she/her/ella) has been part of AMC since she moved to Asheville fr
 om Surfside\, FL in 2008. She has been teaching movement for over 30 years
 \, using music and movements from around the world.\n\nShe loves to motiva
 te people to find freedom in their bodies so they can dance to the spirit.
 \n\nListen to her mixes on Mixcloud ([https://www.mixcloud.com/DancingMart
 a/](https://www.mixcloud.com/DancingMarta/) ) and Soundcloud ([https://sou
 ndcloud.com/dancingmarta](https://soundcloud.com/dancingmarta) )\n\\~\\~\\
 ~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close 
 promptly at Opening Circle and any that come late will be turned away. Ple
 ase be on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Price
 s: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\
 nPre-registration Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunt
 eer and dance for free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovem
 entcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volu
 nteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2
 lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_
 3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\n
 Door will close at the beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO EN
 TRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://a
 shevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollec
 tive.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0R
 XNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_L
 MLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsh
 eville Movement Collective envisions a world that moves in harmony where a
 ll are free to be their authentic selves within a loving community. Our mi
 ssion and aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy community through fr
 ee-form dance by hosting dance waves for personal and community transforma
 tion. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\,
  Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
