SUMMARY:Ecstatic Dance Waves w/ Ted Riskin
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, November 29th\n1st Dan
 ce Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance
  Wave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nFacilita
 tor Ted Riskin\n\nIntention: TBA\n\n## About Ted Riskin\n\nTed is interest
 ed in anything that can get him out of his head\, and music and movement d
 o a pretty good job of that. He hopes to offer music that facilitates an i
 nner journey and invitations that create a shift. While he likes modern el
 ectronic music\, he can’t create a mix without including lots of natural
  instruments and voices. Due to a short attention span\, he mixes in lots 
 of different musical genres. You can hear some of his mixes on [https://ww
 w.mixcloud.com/tarisk/](https://www.mixcloud.com/tarisk/)\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\
 *\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptl
 y at Opening Circle and any that come late will be turned away. Please be 
 on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 
 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-re
 gistration Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and
  dance for free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcoll
 ective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?
 fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyM
 jAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDtt
 Uv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor wi
 ll close at the beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFT
 ER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevill
 emovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.or
 g/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMG
 YXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJW
 Ezr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville 
 Movement Collective envisions a world that moves in harmony where all are 
 free to be their authentic selves within a loving community. Our mission a
 nd aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy community through free-form
  dance by hosting dance waves for personal and community transformation. A
 MC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Ashevi
 lle\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
