SUMMARY:Ecstatic Prom Fundraiser to Benefit AMC
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSaturday\, December 6th\nEvenin
 g Dance Wave 6:00 pm \\- 10:00 pm \\| Warmup 6pm \\| Opening Circle 6:30pm
 \n\nFeaturing Raffle\, Photo Booth\, and Refreshments!\n\nMost of us remem
 ber prom\, whether we went or not. Maybe it was a night you think of fondl
 y\, maybe it was awkward\, or maybe you never went at all. Ecstatic Prom i
 s a grown-up do-over\, a chance to celebrate the dance that brings us all 
 together and have some real fun doing it.\n\nEcstatic dance is a practice 
 of moving freely to music\, letting your body lead instead of following st
 eps or a partner.\n\nFor nearly 25 years\, the Asheville Movement Collecti
 ve has created space for this practice in our city\, growing into a commun
 ity that now dances together every Friday night and Sunday morning. The da
 nce can hold unexpected joy\, space for grief to move\, and moments of fee
 ling at home in your body.\n\nAMC is committed to keeping this dance open 
 to everyone\, regardless of financial means. We hold a No One Turned Away 
 For Lack Of Funds policy\, so reduced and free entry is always available t
 o anyone who needs it. Beyond our weekly dances\, we offer workshops and s
 pecial events for the wider community\, along with free childcare during 2
 nd Wave so parents can dance too.\n\nThat commitment is carried by our who
 le community\, by every dancer whose weekly contribution keeps the dance g
 oing\, and by events like Ecstatic Prom\, an event-based fundraiser. If yo
 u're able to give more at checkout\, it helps keep all of this open to eve
 ryone who wants to be part of it.\n\nNo dance experience needed.\n\nWear w
 hatever feels celebratory and lets you move.\n\nThis is an alcohol and sub
 stance-free space.\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts 
 at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and any that come l
 ate will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure con
 tainer. \\*\\*\n\nTicket Prices:\n$20 until Nov 15\n$25 until Dec 5\n$30 a
 t the door\n\nPre-registration Recommended:\nhttps://ashevillemovementcoll
 ective.org/event/ecstatic-prom/\n\nVOLUNTEER!\nWe need volunteers. Volunte
 er and dance for free! Register to volunteer at:\nhttps://ashevillemovemen
 tcollective.org/volunteer/\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\nDoor will close at
  the beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING 
 CIRCLE!\n\nCollective agreements:\nhttps://ashevillemovementcollective.org
 /our-dance/\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a world
  that moves in harmony where all are free to be their authentic selves wit
 hin a loving community. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity an
 d healthy community through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for per
 sonal and community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organizat
 ion.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the danc
 e floor!
